Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(login):=20premium=20gateway=20redesign=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20large=20ZI=20character=20+=20chips=20around=20it?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Redesigns the sign-in into a single-screen asymmetric two-zone gateway: the login
form sits center-left, a LARGE ZI character (zi-login-access, welcoming the user in
with an open hand + a glowing access card) stands on the physical-right. The two
capability chips sit in opposite outer corners AROUND ZI (one top toward the edge,
one bottom toward the form) so they surround the character without covering it; a
wide soft halo + floor shadow ground it. Fits 100vh without scroll at 1920/1440/1366
(clamp-sized) and stacks cleanly on mobile (form first, smaller ZI below, chips
hidden). Removes the old remote mini-robot + speech bubble.

NO auth logic touched — same signIn server action, fields, validation, error
handling, forgot-password and redirects. ZI image is decorative (alt="",
aria-hidden); every message is real HTML text; error region is aria-live. next/image
with width/height + priority; the character PNG is transparent (checkerboard removed).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cm5NAh92cekdimerQbEsCW
